msgid "Close the preview. Restore only disposable targets through ordinary explicit controls; retain genuine history and shared credentials."
msgstr ""

#: journeys.php:37
msgid "Plugin and theme. Administrator plus the real per-target install/update capability. Installed/configuration variants require supported manual setup."
