#: journeys.php:240
msgid "Use real supported reconciliation and owner-controlled cleanup. Preserve journal history, retention, locks and unrelated records."
msgstr ""

#: journeys.php:241
msgid "Plugin and theme where supported. Manual real attempt required; do not fabricate an attempt ID or correlation reference."
msgstr ""

